
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>GLOBAL DEAL</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:#071426;color:#fff;font-family:Arial,sans-serif}
header{padding:25px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid #b99a55}
.logo{color:#d9b65e;font-size:27px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px}
.tag{color:#aaa;font-size:12px;margin-top:7px}
main{padding:22px 18px;max-width:700px;margin:auto}
h1{font-size:34px;line-height:1.2}
.gold{color:#d9b65e}
.search{width:100%;padding:16px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #b99a55;background:#10233b;color:white;font-size:16px}
h2{margin-top:32px}
.categories{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}
.category,.deal{background:#10233b;border:1px solid #263c54;border-radius:14px;padding:20px}
.category{color:#e5c477;text-align:center}
.deal{margin-top:12px}
button{background:#d9b65e;color:#071426;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 18px;font-weight:bold}
footer{text-align:center;padding:30px;color:#aaa;font-size:12px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<div class="logo">GLOBAL DEAL</div>
<div class="tag">ONE WORLD. EVERY DEAL. PROTECTED BY AI.</div>
</header>
<main>
<h1>Discover opportunities <span class="gold">worldwide.</span></h1>
<p>One marketplace. Endless possibilities.</p>
<input class="search" placeholder="Search global deals...">
<h2>Explore categories</h2>
<div class="categories">
<div class="category">🏠 Property</div>
<div class="category">🚗 Vehicles</div>
<div class="category">💎 Luxury</div>
<div class="category">💼 Business</div>
<div class="category">📱 Electronics</div>
<div class="category">🌍 Other deals</div>
</div>
<h2>Featured deals</h2>
<div class="deal">
<h3>Global opportunities</h3>
<p>Discover deals from around the world.</p>
<button onclick="alert('Coming soon!')">Explore deals</button>
</div>
<div class="deal">
<h3 class="gold">AI Deal Guardian</h3>
<p>Our vision: smarter and safer global transactions.</p>
<button onclick="alert('AI protection coming soon!')">Discover AI</button>
</div>
</main>
<footer>GLOBAL DEAL © 2026 · One world. Every deal.</footer>
</body>
</html>
